      "comment": "CATCHING (7) missed the frame last time when fifth (17.32) at this track but prior to that had three placings in a row. Can atone. VAPOUR GLOW (1) held her own to the line last start and filled a minor placing, beaten only a neck (17.99) behind Puddin' Cake at Mt Gambier. Has a win and two minor placings from three starts from this draw. Will give a great sight again. MICKEY HALLER (4) goes very well this trip starting 13 times for five wins and four minors. In the money last time at this track (19.20) in a Grade 5, finishing a 3.5 lengths third. Can feature in the finish. HELLO SWEETHEART (2) drops in journey and can play a major role.",
